  "description": "Let me warm you up tonight. \n\nOn a cold winter night, Hyeon-Su finds a stranger named Ji-Hyo injured and huddled just outside her home. When she kindly takes him in, he wishes to return the favor. Will they find comfort in the warmth of their intimate embrace, or will Ji-Hyo's past be too much to bear? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
